UPDATE glossary SET description = 'Known as "The Keeper." A mysterious figure with piercing ocean-blue eyes, dark windswept hair, and scarred hands bearing faint glowing runes. He wears a dark cloak with intricate detailing, carries an ornate amulet and rings set with blue stones, and bears a distinctive symbol tied to his secretive order. He stands sentinel over an infant and leads a group with knowledge of ancient gifts, speaking of the child being their "legacy—our hero, or our demon."' WHERE term = 'Felm';